# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data objects are never committed. The count matrices are deposited at GEO
# (GSE150703); the merged Drop-seq matrix and every Seurat object live on the
# cluster. See the root README for how to obtain them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Seurat / SingleCellExperiment objects and other R state
*.rds
*.Rds
*.RDS
*.RData
*.rda
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# count matrices, loom, HDF5, mtx
*.loom
*.h5
*.h5ad
*.h5seurat
*.mtx
*.mtx.gz
*.txt.gz
*.tsv.gz
*.csv.gz

# large plain-text matrices: the DGE matrices are .txt, so .txt is excluded
# wholesale and documentation is written in .md instead
*.txt
!requirements.txt

# batch-job logs
*.Rout
slurm-*.out
*.job.report

# reference databases: cached beside the data, never in the repo
reference/*
!reference/PROVENANCE.txt

# per-folder figure output directories are untracked; only the assembled
# figures under the root figures/ are committed
*/figures/
*/*/figures/
*/*/*/figures/

# editor / OS
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
